    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Red Passport: Ticket to Russia \u2014 an adventure game that takes you to the heart of Russia! Begin your journey in a cozy apartment, where the first puzzles set the stage for your epic quest. Pack your bags, head to the airport, and board a plane to a new city. But that\u2019s just the start \u2014 an unforgettable train ride across Russia\u2019s vast landscapes awaits, leading you to Vladivostok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Story: Unravel mysteries and stories hidden at every step of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locations: From an atmospheric city apartment to a bustling airport, a plane, and an iconic train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Challenges: Use your wits to overcome obstacles and progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Immersion: Experience Russia\u2019s essence through detailed landscapes, sounds, and unique elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Passport: Ticket to Russia is a journey full of discoveries, where every step brings you closer to your destination. Can you reach Vladivostok and uncover all its secrets?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Red Passport: Ticket to Russia \u2014 an adventure game that takes you to the heart of Russia! Begin your journey in a cozy apartment, where the first puzzles set the stage for your epic quest. Pack your bags, head to the airport, and board a plane to a new city. But that\u2019s just the start \u2014 an unforgettable train ride across Russia\u2019s vast landscapes awaits, leading you to Vladivostok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Story: Unravel mysteries and stories hidden at every step of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locations: From an atmospheric city apartment to a bustling airport, a plane, and an iconic train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Challenges: Use your wits to overcome obstacles and progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Immersion: Experience Russia\u2019s essence through detailed landscapes, sounds, and unique elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Passport: Ticket to Russia is a journey full of discoveries, where every step brings you closer to your destination. Can you reach Vladivostok and uncover all its secrets?</p>",
